From: Anton Argirov <anton.argirov@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 17:55:09 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(baseconf): emulate UART over the host bridge

Expose BaseConf UART registers through the existing host character bridge.
Buffer RX and TX without blocking the emulated CPU, flush pending output
once per frame, and expose the bridge through startup and configuration.

